      "diff": "@@ -635,32 +635,38 @@ Windows Build:\n     - msbuild /verbosity:minimal /maxcpucount test-programs.vcxproj\n     - ctest -C RelWithDebInfo --parallel 3 --force-new-ctest-process --output-on-failure\n \n-.ABI Check:\n+ABI Check:\n   extends: .build-ubuntu\n   rules: !reference [.if-merge-request]\n+  variables:\n+    # Use DWARF-4. ABI dumper version 1.3 is required for DWARF-5 support (the GCC 11 default) but version 1.3 is still not released.\n+    # https://github.com/lvc/abi-dumper/issues/34\n+    CFLAGS: \"-Og -gdwarf-4\"\n   script:\n     # build-ubuntu puts us in `build`.\n     - DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get update\n     - DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get --yes install abi-dumper abi-compliance-checker\n-    # Ubuntu 20.04 ships with version 1.1, which has issues: https://github.com/lvc/abi-dumper/issues/21\n-    - curl --fail -JL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lvc/abi-dumper/1.2/abi-dumper.pl > /usr/bin/abi-dumper\n-    # ABI dumper version 1.3 required for DWARF-5 support (the GCC 11 default). Version 1.3 is still not released.\n-    # https://github.com/lvc/abi-dumper/issues/34\n-    - CFLAGS=\"-Og -gdwarf-4\" cmake -G Ninja -DENABLE_CCACHE=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug -DBUILD_wireshark=OFF ..\n+    # CMake build type None is required to prevent CMake from adding its own debug flags and clobbering our own.\n+    - cmake -G Ninja -DENABLE_CCACHE=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=None -DBUILD_wireshark=OFF ..\n     - ninja wiretap-abi-dump epan-abi-dump wsutil-abi-dump\n-    - ACC_EXIT=0\n-    - abi-compliance-checker -l wiretap -old ../tools/abi-dumps/wiretap-abi-12.0.0.dump -new wiretap-abi-12*.dump || ACC_EXIT=1\n-    - abi-compliance-checker -l epan -old ../tools/abi-dumps/epan-abi-15.0.0.dump -new epan-abi-15*.dump || ACC_EXIT=1\n-    - abi-compliance-checker -l wsutil -old ../tools/abi-dumps/wsutil-abi-13.0.0.dump -new wsutil-abi-13*.dump || ACC_EXIT=1\n-    - mv compat_reports ..\n+    - set +e\n+    - abi-compliance-checker -l wiretap -old ../tools/abi-dumps/wiretap-abi-12.0.1.dump -new wiretap-abi-12*.dump\n+    - WIRETAP_EXIT=$?\n+    - abi-compliance-checker -l epan -old ../tools/abi-dumps/epan-abi-15.0.1.dump -new epan-abi-15*.dump\n+    - EPAN_EXIT=$?\n+    - abi-compliance-checker -l wsutil -old ../tools/abi-dumps/wsutil-abi-13.0.1.dump -new wsutil-abi-13*.dump\n+    - WSUTIL_EXIT=$?\n+    - set -e\n+    - printf \"WIRETAP_EXIT=%d EPAN_EXIT=%d WSUTIL_EXIT=%d\\\\n\" $WIRETAP_EXIT $EPAN_EXIT $WSUTIL_EXIT\n+    - mv compat_reports ../compat_reports_3.6\n     - mv *-abi-*.dump ..\n     - cd ..\n-    - zip -9 -r compat_reports.zip compat_reports\n-    - exit $ACC_EXIT\n+    - zip -9 -r compat_reports_3.6.zip compat_reports_3.6\n+    - exit $(( WIRETAP_EXIT + EPAN_EXIT + WSUTIL_EXIT ))\n   artifacts:\n     when: always\n     paths:\n-      - compat_reports.zip\n+      - compat_reports_3.6.zip\n       - ./*-abi-*.dump\n \n # Fuzz TShark using ASAN and valgrind.\n",
